  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees.",
    "Cook the tagliatelle according to package instructions.",
    "In a large skillet, heat the olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Stir in the moroccan spices and cook for 1 minute.",
    "In a large bowl, combine the cooked tagliatelle, bonito flakes, and chickpeas.",
    "Add the lemon juice and toss to combine.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a baking dish and bake for 20 minutes."
